[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3539152377","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112837#issuecomment-3539152377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112837","id":3539152377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S8y35","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T19:12:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T19:12:22Z","body":"This PR is very not ideal.\r\n\r\nThe idea of _unifying_ theme items into a single **Variant** type has been thrown around numerous times in discussions. It's relevant even in seemingly unrelated cases, like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111455 .\r\n\r\nBut, at the very least, this should be a new item type. Overriding theme constants themselves to return **Variant** is not only a hack, but has a lot of ramifications because theme constants are currently always assumed to be integers, or at the very least numerical.\r\nAs you can see from the [PR you are referencing from](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87243#issuecomment-1893442357), there are huge concerns over doing this. It's why turning theme constants into floating-point numbers wasn't accepted in the past, let alone every possible **Variant** type. No way this PR can be merged in its current state.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3539152377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3541943353","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112837#issuecomment-3541943353","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112837","id":3541943353,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7THcQ5","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T13:53:18Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T13:53:18Z","body":"It seems that I didn't pay enough attention to background compatibility.\r\nThanks for the review an explanation!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comm